["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">枝</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>树枝；分支；细枝；枝条；计数树枝的量词</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">えだ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">枝</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えだ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">枝；树枝</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">塗</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>涂抹；涂刷；涂覆；沾染；涂层</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ト</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ぬ.る・ぬ.り・まみ.れる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">塗る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぬる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">涂；涂抹；敷；上漆；刷；贴（壁纸）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">軒</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>屋檐；栋（房屋量词）；轩（房屋量词）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">のき</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">軒</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">のき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">屋檐；房檐；檐廊；寺院建筑核心部周围的狭窄走廊</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">軒並み</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">のきなみ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">一排房屋；每户人家；各家各户；全部；一律；普遍</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">毒</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>毒；病毒；毒素；恶意；伤害</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ドク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">毒</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">どく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">毒；毒物；毒液；危害；恶劣影响；恶意；怨恨；仇恨；辱骂性语言；恶言</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">気の毒</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きのどく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">可怜；不幸；悲惨；困苦；不可饶恕；遗憾；可惜</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">消毒</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうどく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">消毒；灭菌；杀菌</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">叫</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>喊叫；呼喊；大声说</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さけ.ぶ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">叫ぶ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さけぶ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">大声喊叫；呼喊；尖叫；惊叫；呐喊；高呼；（对某事）大声疾呼；倡导；坚持主张；抗议；呼吁</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">叫び</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さけび</span><span class=\"k-wz\">叫喊；喊声；呼喊；尖叫；惊叫；嚎叫</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">拝</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>参拜；礼拜；祈祷；崇拜；拜见</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ハイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おが.む・おろが.む</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">拝見</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はいけん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（谦让语）看；拜读；拜观</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">拝む</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おがむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">合掌；行礼；拜礼；向（如佛像等）表示敬礼；乞求；恳求；哀求；拜见；瞻仰（身份高的人或事物）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">崇拝</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すうはい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">崇拜；崇敬；钦佩；狂热崇拜</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">氷</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>冰；冻结；冰雹；结冰；冰柱</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヒョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">こおり・ひ・こお.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">氷</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こおり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">冰；刨冰；冰沙</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">乾</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>干；干燥；晒干；喝干；天</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カン・ケン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かわ.く・かわ.かす・ほ.す・ひ.る・いぬい</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">乾く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かわく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">干；变干；干燥</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">乾燥</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんそう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">干燥；干旱；烘干；脱水；干燥处理；枯燥乏味；无趣味</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">乾杯</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんぱい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">干杯；敬酒；为某人或某事祝酒；干杯；一饮而尽；喝干杯中酒</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">棒</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>棒；棍；杆；杖；线</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ボウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">泥棒</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">どろぼう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">小偷；盗贼；抢劫犯；偷窃；盗窃；抢劫</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">棒</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぼう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">杆；棒；棍；指挥棒；线；横线；破折号；单调地说话</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">鉄棒</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">てつぼう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">铁棒；铁杆；铁棍；单杠</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">祈</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>祈祷；祝愿</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いの.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">祈る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いのる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">祈祷；祈求；念祷文；做祷告；祈愿；希望；期盼</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">祈り</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いのり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">祈祷；祈求；祷告</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">拾</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>拾起；收集；发现；步行；十</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シュウ・ジュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ひろ.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">拾う</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひろう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">捡起；拾取；收集；捡到；拾到（捡起掉落的东西）；选择；挑选；选出；意外获得；碰上（运气、机会等）；侥幸夺得（意外之胜）；侥幸成功；接（人）；用车接送（某人）；招手拦（出租车）；打车；接收；捕捉（信号、声音、干扰等）；勉强回球；接回（难度大的球）；收留；雇用；给予工作机会；收容；步行；徒步</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">粉</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>面粉；粉末；灰尘</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">フン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">デシメートル・こ・こな</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">粉</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こな</span><span class=\"k-wz\">粉；面粉；粉末；灰尘；海洛因</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">花粉</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かふん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">花粉</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">粉々</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こなごな</span><span class=\"k-wz\">粉碎的；碎成粉末的</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">糸</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>线；丝；弦</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いと</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">糸</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いと</span><span class=\"k-wz\">线；纱</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">毛糸</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けいと</span><span class=\"k-wz\">毛线；羊毛纱</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">綿</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>棉花；棉絮；细密；绵延</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">メン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">わた</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">木綿</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もめん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">棉；棉布；木棉树</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">綿</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">めん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">棉</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">汗</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>汗；出汗</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あせ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">汗</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あせ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">汗；汗液；湿气；凝结水；（表示尴尬或紧张）呃；哎呀</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">銅</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>铜</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ドウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あかがね</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">銅</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">どう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">铜（化学元素Cu）；铜牌；铜质奖牌</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">湿</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>湿；湿润；潮湿</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シツ・シュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">しめ.る・しめ.す・うるお.う・うるお.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">湿気</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しっけ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">湿气；湿度；潮湿</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">湿度</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しつど</span><span class=\"k-wz\">湿度</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">湿る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しめる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">变得潮湿；变得湿润；变得潮；受潮；缺乏精力；情绪低落；精神不振；心情沮丧</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">瓶</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>瓶子；壶；罐；缸；瓮</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ビン・ヘイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かめ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">花瓶</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かびん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">花瓶；插花瓶</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">瓶</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かめ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">陶罐；陶土罐</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">瓶詰</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">びんづめ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">装瓶；瓶装；瓶装的</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">咲</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>开花；绽放</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さ.く・-ざき</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">咲く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">开花；绽放；盛开；（波浪）涌起；翻腾</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">召</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>召唤；召集；吃喝（敬语）；穿（敬语）；乘坐（敬语）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">め.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">召し上がる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">めしあがる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">吃；喝</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">召す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">めす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">召唤；传召；邀请；召请；吃；喝；穿；戴；买；购买；洗澡；乘坐；上车；搭乘；感冒；着凉；增岁；变老；合意；称心；令人满意；做；干；切腹自尽；表示尊敬</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">缶</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>罐；容器</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かま</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">缶</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">罐；听；罐头；罐装食品</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">缶詰</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんづめ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">罐头食品；罐装食品；禁闭某人（如使其专心工作等）；被困在狭小空间内</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">薬缶</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">やかん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">水壶；茶壶；光头；秃头</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">隻</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>船只；只（用于数鱼、鸟、箭等）；一对中的一个</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セキ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">脂</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>脂肪；油脂；树脂；胶；焦油</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あぶら</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">脂</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あぶら</span><span class=\"k-wz\">脂肪；动物油脂；猪油；油脂</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">脂肪</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しぼう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">脂肪；油脂；猪油；板油</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">蒸</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>蒸；蒸汽；蒸发；闷热；焖</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジョウ・セイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">む.す・む.れる・む.らす</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">蒸気</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じょうき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">蒸汽；水蒸气；蒸气；蒸汽船；蒸汽机车</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">蒸発</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じょうはつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">蒸发；（人的）失踪；凭空消失</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">蒸す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">むす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">蒸；蒸制；闷热；潮湿闷热</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">肌</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>皮肤；纹理；质地；气质</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">はだ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">肌</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はだ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">皮肤；（肌肤相亲时的）身体；肌肤；表面；纹理；质地；气质；性质；类型</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">肌着</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はだぎ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">内衣；贴身衣物；衬衣；汗衫</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">耕</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>耕作；犁地；耕种</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たがや.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">耕地</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">耕地；种植地；农田；庄园；大农场；大地产</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">耕す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たがやす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">耕耘；耕作；开垦</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">耕作</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうさく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">耕作；农耕</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">鈍</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>迟钝；愚笨；不锋利；缓慢</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ドン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">にぶ.い・にぶ.る・にぶ-・なま.る・なまく.ら</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">鈍い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">にぶい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">钝；不锋利；迟钝；愚钝；笨；暗淡；昏暗；沉闷；缓慢；迟缓；呆滞；无力；迟钝；不灵敏；反应迟钝；无感觉</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">鈍感</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">どんかん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">迟钝；不敏感；呆板；厚脸皮</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">鈍る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">にぶる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">变钝；失去锋利；能力减退；衰弱；减弱</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">泥</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>泥；附着；停滞</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">デイ・ナイ・デ・ニ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">どろ・なず.む</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">泥棒</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">どろぼう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">小偷；盗贼；抢劫犯；偷窃；盗窃；抢劫</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">泥</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">どろ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">泥；泥巴；（湿）泥土；贼；小偷；安卓系统</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">隅</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>角落；隅</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">グウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">すみ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">隅</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すみ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">角落；壁角；凹处；（能舞台的）台前右侧；舞台右前角</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">灯</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>灯；灯火；光；灯（计数单位）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">トウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ひ・ほ-・ともしび・とも.す・あかり</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">電灯</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">でんとう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">电灯</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">灯</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ともしび</span><span class=\"k-wz\">灯光；灯火；火炬</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">灯台</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とうだい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">灯塔；油灯；传统室内油灯</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">辛</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>辛辣；痛苦；艰苦；难受；严酷</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">から.い・つら.い・-づら.い・かのと</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">辛い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">からい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">辛辣；麻辣；咸；有盐味；尖刻；严厉；严苛；痛苦；苦涩；艰难；难熬</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">塩辛い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しおからい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">咸的；有盐味的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">辛抱</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんぼう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">耐心；忍耐；坚持</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">磨</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>研磨；磨光；擦洗；改善；刷牙</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">マ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">みが.く・す.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">磨く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">みがく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">抛光；擦亮；磨光；磨；清洁；刷（牙）；磨制（镜片等）；磨练；提高；精进；完善；培养</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">歯磨き</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はみがき</span><spa